<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n62053" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λατραβιάζειν:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσπουδασμένως καὶ ἀσήμως λαλεῖν</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>; cf. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λατράζειν:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαρβαρίζειν</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λατραβός</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαμυρός</span>
			, and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λατραβία</span></b> 
				(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λατραπία</span> cod.), 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαμυρία μετὰ
				ἐρυθριάσεως</span>
			, Id.:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λατραβῶν:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλαζονευόμενος</span>, and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλατράβιζον:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ βωμολοχεύειν καὶ πανουργεῖν</span>
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λατραβίζειν ἔλεγον</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λατράζειν</span></b> , 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λατραβιάζειν</span>
			. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λατραίω</span></b> , 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λατρείω</span>
			. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λάτραψ:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑετός</span>, Id.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
